    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "those are a good start but they feel a bit generic. can u go deeper with the \"sloth\" argument? like, how can they frame it so it doesn't just sound like an opinion, but like an inevitable economic fact? i want them to really make the Pro side look like they don't understand how human nature or inflation actually works.",
