      "content": "that's perfect. it sounds much more authoritative that way. can you do the same for the inflation point? instead of just saying \"it might cause inflation,\" give me a way to frame it as an absolute certainty that the UBI policy is basically just a precursor to hyperinflation and economic collapse. i want the rebuttal to sound like the economic consequences are a mathematical inevitability.",
